      "evidence_id": "e-a30b7b4c0ab9a705186d",
      "text": "Kimolos is perfectly positioned for island hopping adventures across the Aegean Sea. With frequent ferry routes connecting Kimolos to neighboring islands, it’s easy to turn your stay into a multi-island escape. The short ferry ride to Milos is especially popular, but you’ll also find direct connections to other ports, making it simple to plan your own Cycladic journey. Kimolos is an ideal base for exploring the beautiful islands and remote beaches that surround it.",
