      "text": "Once you’re in Milos, you can take a ferry from the port of Pollonia in Milos to Kimolos. The ferry ride usually takes around 20-30 minutes, and ferries are frequent, especially during peak tourist season. Kimolos is also connected by ferry to other islands in the Cyclades, so if you are island hopping, you can easily include Kimolos in your itinerary.",
